{"items": [{"shortCode": "DcJEGQIIwW3", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcJEGQIIwW3/", "caption": "#AD If you have a kid heading off to college this fall, this needs to go in their care package. As a 2-decades-deep cleaning expert, I first tried the Scrubbing Bubbles Easy Peasy\u2122 Foaming Toilet Cleaner back in spring \u00a0and while this is a paid partnership, I kept using it because I genuinely loved it. Now that back-to-school season is here, I keep thinking about all the students cleaning a toilet on their own for the very first time. This is the product for that moment. You just rip the pouch, sprinkle into the bowl (not the tank), let it foam, flush. Done. It handles odours between deep cleans. For really tough stains a little scrubbing may be required, but this does the heavy lifting for you.\n\nPack it in a care package. Seriously.\u2028\nIn Canada you\u2019ll find it at Walmart, Shoppers, Superstore, Metro, Sobeys, Freshco, Fortinos, Home Depot, Jean Coutu, and Amazon. @ScrubbingBubblesCanada\n#EasyPeasy #ScrubbingBubbles #BathroomCleaning #BackToSchool CleanMySpace", "timestamp": "2026-08-17T12:46:09.000Z", "videoDuration": 54.099998, "videoPlayCount": 7051, "likesCount": 87, "commentsCount": 2, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fbne9-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/775858414_18615427993058971_1588812061644086836_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ig_cache_key=Mzk2NTcxODk2ODY5NTcxOTM1MTE4NjE1NDI3OTg3MDU4OTcx.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEzMjAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=5RC8N9zC2FgQ7kNvwGJZgNQ&_nc_oc=AdpjA9DiShCGQwsvL_8XW66ysH49wPQRq5hm-PT1_GaKlZ2J2GRF_5XZuZU7YSeMVQs&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fbne9-1.fna&_nc_gid=VCqd6-E0l9x2PYxQQYhx5A&_nc_ss=72a8c&oh=00_AQHNXuNvWGiYeXIab_RIN4jvE8IyHqQzQyXx4Cx82s708A&oe=6A909E49", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fmex1-4.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQNuskycBvcQrkA1pWSCzuYCDHcGfly2kW5Z4bYp9PY6JcQmpOhfNWhcp1DU0OEu1IhquP1JteOqP8kFe4SjS_gbSHI